	(text "The VERA X (pin 1 SCL, 2 SDA: unconnected).\nIRQ# drives IRQA directly (a 3.3K pull-up on the board);\na 74LS07 gate between them if the line misbehaves.\nAudio: if pins 25/26 sit at a DC level, 10 uF in series\nwith each (+ toward the VERA)."
