	(text "Never use breakout J11 pin 3: slot 0 carries -5 V there (the card labels it +5VA).\nBreakout J7 pin 5 is /DMAB (slot pin 23), not an inverted R/W: the strobes use RWB (J7 pin 4).\nKeep the bus wires short (15 cm or less); a ground wire beside PHI2. Plug and unplug with the power off.\nThe wiring guide: reborn/docs/vera-wiring.md (timing, bring-up, the SMC's firmware)."
